OL,3,GNEWSAOfficers injured and vehicles
OL,4,Adamaged in Portsmouth small boats
OL,5,Aprotest, police say
OL,6,
OL,7,FA small number of officers were injured
OL,8,Fand some vehicles damaged during a
OL,9,Fprotest against small boat crossings in
OL,10,FPortsmouth last night, police say
OL,12,FHundreds blocked roads in the city
OL,13,Fafter about 120 migrants were brought
OL,14,Fto shore
OL,16,FThere was a similar protest in Dover on
OL,17,FSaturday - policing minister Sarah
OL,18,FJones is expected to make a statement
OL,19,Fabout both in Parliament soon. You can
OL,20,Fwatch live at the top of the page
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
