OL,3,GNEWSAOfficers injured and vehicles
OL,4,Adamaged in Portsmouth small boats
OL,5,Aprotest, police say
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe government has condemned
OL,8,F"intimidating and thuggish behaviour"
OL,9,Fat the protest in Portsmouth
OL,11,FOn the protest in Dover, Reform UK's
OL,12,FNigel Farage says: "Peaceful protest:
OL,13,Fgood. Uniforms and masks: bad"
OL,15,FOne protester in Portsmouth tells the
OL,16,FBBC people are "absolutely fed up" with
OL,17,Fsmall boat arrivals, but one local says
OL,18,Fsome protesters' views made her
OL,19,F"genuinely unsettled"
